<title>UK: OPEC basket price rose 24 cents to $16.84 on Monday.</title>
<headline>OPEC basket price rose 24 cents to $16.84 on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of OPEC's basket of seven crudes stood at $16.84 per barrel on Monday, against $16.60 the previous day, according to the OPEC Secretariat's calculations, the OPEC news agency said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The basket comprises Algeria's Saharan Blend, Indonesia's Minas, Nigeria's Bonny Light, Saudi Arabia's Arabian Light, Dubai of the UAE, Venezuela's Tia Juana and Mexico's Isthmus.</p>
